139 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 61 0 R
/T (This project aimed to design a multidimensional house for a family of 16 members on a site located in Behrampur \(West Bengal\). Based on the given site, I developed a detailed architectural plan and a 3D rendered model of the house. The objective of the project was to develop an understanding of spatial organization, circulation patterns, and functional zoning within a large family residence. It focused on determining how the rooms for different family members should be arranged, how movement within the house should flow efficiently, and how furniture and other household elements should be organized within the spaces.)
/E (This project aimed to design a multidimensional house for a family of 16 members on a site located in Behrampur \(West Bengal\). Based on the given site, I developed a detailed architectural plan and a 3D rendered model of the house. The objective of the project was to develop an understanding of spatial organization, circulation patterns, and functional zoning within a large family residence. It focused on determining how the rooms for different family members should be arranged, how movement within the house should flow efficiently, and how furniture and other household elements should be organized within the spaces.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [25 26]
>>
endobj
