/S /H4
/P 63 0 R
/T (The aim of this project is to develop an appropriate and visually balanced lighting design for a residential house by identifying and selecting suitable lighting fixtures and their placements based on the function and character of each space. The focus is on choosing the right types of lights and fixtures for different areas, ensuring proper brightness, comfort, and aesthetics to make the spaces both practical and visually appealing.)
